{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-08_end","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-07","title":"無處可尋","storyCode":"16-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"6a45115f98f8ba62463300e983fbd62e6589853753fe9a919a079390608e142e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為取得“奧卡”樣本，科謝尼婭帶領博士和Mon3tr前往礦井。流亡的礦工們放棄了缺乏能源的代步工具，雷爾金帶人去附近的村莊求助。村民們提供了熱心的幫助，卻沒有發現危險近在眼前。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北中心礦區</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"需要休息一下嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？不……不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果你現在還有顧慮……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們也可以自己去找。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幫你們帶路是我自己的選擇，何況我自己確實也想知道關於“奧卡”的真相，我沒什麼顧慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算將來追查到我，最多也只是被流放而已……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，前面的路應該是安全的，我沒有偵測到其他人的存在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"narration","text":"科謝尼婭的視線掃向Mon3tr，很快又僵硬地撇開。\n你注意到這一路上，這位研究員一直默默跟在Mon3tr的身後，時不時打量著她，而現在連Mon3tr都察覺到了這一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭，你一直在偷看我……我有哪裡看起來很奇怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？不，不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我只是，看著你，想起了一些很久以前的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看……問題就在於，其實我也沒辦法完全想起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些記憶太久遠了，已經模糊到看不清楚，像是泡了水之後字跡散成一團的紙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也許……我可以問你一些問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以！雖然我也不確定自己能不能回答得出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，你叫Mon3tr，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，這是我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr……Mon3tr。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她輕輕地咀嚼著這個陌生的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr小姐，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會不會很冷……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說……我的意思是，你穿得很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你需要的話，我可以把外套脫下來給你，至少能在進入礦洞前幫你擋一些風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只是它可能有點舊了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦、哦！我知道了，不用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你是第一個問我這種問題的人，所以我有點反應不過來，但我確實不冷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（對Mon3tr搖頭）","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我不覺得冷，但還是謝謝你的關心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你剛才是想說什麼嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]},{"label":"（向科謝尼婭點頭）","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒事，你們聊吧。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的，科謝尼婭，你可以信任我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們之後還要同行一段路，有什麼問題都可以問我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們剛才提到，你們是凱爾希所長的同伴……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希所長……她現在，還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你很瞭解凱爾希嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想……或許不算很瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我只是作為伊利亞老師的助手參與研究，能直接接觸到凱爾希所長的機會並不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我只記得一些……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_graduate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭！科謝尼婭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老師，我在……我在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早上的實驗數據為什麼還沒有出現在我的桌上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起老師，我現在就去拿！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我說過多少遍了，想參與的話就要跟上整個計劃的速度。如果我需要的只是一個把儀錶上的數字抄到紙上的助手，那我三歲的女兒也做得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有，這些稿紙上寫的是什麼？能量轉換公式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭，我認為你應該先做好自己的本分，再去做其他的嘗試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不值得浪費您時間的東西，凱爾希所長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭畢竟還只是一個年輕的學生，需要一點時間才能熟悉實驗計劃，如果出了什麼問題，也是我的責任……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你推導出的公式？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有創意的理論模型，推演的邏輯也沒有問題。假如這個公式成立的話，我們將得到一套轉化率極高的供能裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這些數據似乎沒有考慮到損失的動能，整體的有效性還有待驗證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真要命……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對……對不起，凱爾希所長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必道歉。你只是想積極地參與計劃，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一次彙報，你也可以來旁聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，不必那麼苛責，伊利亞。年輕人的探索慾彌足珍貴，你應該適當地給予鼓勵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在這個年紀時，犯過的那些錯比這個還要離譜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊利亞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，您說得對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"謝……謝謝您……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希所長……她確實曾一度點燃過我的理想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾經和在那裡的許多人一樣，無比迫切地希望這個對石棺的研究，最終能指向一種全新的、人人都能受益的乾淨能源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此，礦工就能從危險的礦區作業中解放出來，感染者不再需要用生命當作燃料去驅動烏薩斯這頭畸形的龐然大物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時的我是多麼天真，竟從未想過……國家性格的形成也像人一樣有其原因，它不是那樣輕易就能被撼動或改變的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，在那場事故之後能再次聽到凱爾希所長的名字，我真的很高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想，至少，我能不能——能不能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見到她？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"科謝尼婭，關於這件事……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉！如果這個請求讓你們很為難，那就當我沒有說過吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是以為，你們聽起來、看起來，都和所長有關，你們也許會認識她、知道她的去向，或者清楚她過得好不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我說不定也沒有資格知道這些就是了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會再見到凱爾希的，肯定會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這麼說她確實還……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，我們都會再見到凱爾希的。博士，對不對？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……沒錯。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會期待的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，我也想去塞拉菲娜提到的、凱爾希所長創立的“羅德島”看看……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下……有點奇怪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們一路走過來，好像完全沒有見到任何人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是礦工，這裡已經很接近礦井了，我們連一支糾察隊、一個衛兵都沒有看到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"女大公封鎖了整個礦區。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這裡的人應該都被轉移了？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"封鎖礦區的事情我知道，但把人員轉移——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……這和我得知的情況不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為這裡的問題只關乎“奧卡”的實驗失敗，可是我從來沒有聽說過有誰要清空整個礦區。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"的確很奇怪。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"自從我們進入礦區後，遇到的防衛力量就少得可憐。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"甚至不如布列斯克城內的防守嚴密。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那些消失的礦工……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"到底去了哪裡？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g7_farnorthtundra"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>烏薩斯遠北地區，苔原</>\n雷爾金在車廂的門板上刻下最後一筆，然後丟掉了石頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會畫這個符號了，下次我幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，下次換你來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這邊都整理好了，其他車廂裡的東西也都搬出來了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保爾他們那邊已經搬完了，剩下兩輛車裡面本來就沒什麼可以用的物資，我們要把機械零件拆下來帶走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你說你以前在城裡的機械廠工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就拆一些在其他機器上也能用的零件吧，或許還能賣點錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前提是……有人願意接手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有傷員也需要考慮在內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊伍裡有太多失去行動能力的傷員，在沒有代步工具的條件下立刻繼續上路，這根本不現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要休整。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金！東西都清點完了，省著點吃預計能撐兩三天吧，應該足以讓我們走到下一個村莊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為會更多一點……沒什麼，有糧食就已經很不錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別喬克還帶人挖到了一些鼷獸囤積的堅果，比較耐餓，而且能放很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在比起食物，我們更缺醫療物資——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們能去哪裡找這些東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只有移動城市或者流動醫療點了，如果能聯絡到流動醫療點……"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金下意識地看向Raidian。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以嘗試聯絡附近的流動醫療點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您，塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先別急著道謝，我有一個條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，我感謝你和你的小隊為我們提供的幫助，但我們現在的情況——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"條件是，在我嘗試聯絡流動醫療點期間，傷員不能繼續趕路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為醫護人員，我認為傷員需要繼續休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會隨意移動他們的那種休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要帶哪些人去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特、保爾還有幾個能從他們工廠主管手裡哄出一些好處的老油條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你過去並不喜歡那幾個洗礦廠裡出來的油滑傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這與我的喜好無關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不帶我一起？就因為我可能會反駁你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是去附近的村莊求助，不是去聖駿堡的舞會上募款，“長官”。你那套東西，對大字不識的農民沒用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再這樣叫我，我會打爛你的鼻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕在那之前你的手指骨就斷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你並不覺得去村莊求助是個好主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在塞拉菲娜女士聯絡到流動醫療點之前，我們不能就這樣無所事事地待著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是傷員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們不是沒有無所事事過。大家之前還唱過歌、跳過舞——你還拉了手風琴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也說了，那是之前。現有的物資很快就會用完，在那之前，我必須做些力所能及的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而在我們離開的時候……我需要你留在這裡，照顧剩下的所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不認為這次那些村民就會向我們提供幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，感染者不是普通人開門時樂見的對象，這點我們已經從之前的經歷裡很深刻地體會到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金進去多久了？我們要不要進去看看情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你冷靜點，雷爾金讓我們等消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是上次——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出來吧，“小枝條”。我知道你一直跟著我們。雷爾金肯定也發現了，他只是不說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不跟尼克托他們一起留在後方呢？你奶奶也需要你的照顧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶說，沒關係……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，幫忙。所以就，來了。我能幫忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托知道你跟著我們來了嗎？他會以為你脫隊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，留了，信……給他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也可以。其實我也覺得你能幫上忙，但是雷爾金說什麼都不願意帶你一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師……他去，做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他去交涉了，看能不能從村民手裡換到一點糧食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，用什麼……和他們換？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車輛上面的零件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他明明什麼也沒帶就過去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……也許他要先展示一下友善的態度，拿著武器或零件鐵塊過去不算是毫無威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，上次他也什麼都沒帶，結果那些人一邊和他周旋，一邊派人從後門出去叫了糾察隊過來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去幫他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保爾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……我們也跟上去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你給我站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金就在裡面——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"礦工伸出手摀住同伴的嘴，閃到一旁。\n門內傳出模糊的交談聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……明白……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（金屬摩擦的聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……已經……去通知……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（撞擊聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）這些動靜聽起來很不對勁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔嗚嗚嗚——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）答應我你不會直接闖進去，我就放手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"恢復正常呼吸的一瞬間，情緒激動的礦工就將手指向了民宅的後門。\n所有人都看到了雪地上那幾枚向遠處延伸的、清晰的腳印。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……該死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你們幾個，隨便來一個人去敲門。急迫一點，等裡面的人詢問就編個藉口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"油滑的礦工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）憑什麼你不去？萬一雷爾金已經被抓住了，下一個不就輪到敲門的人嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我、我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）不，別喬克——"},{"type":"narration","text":"別喬克屈起手指，輕輕敲在木門上。\n從門內傳來的聲響幾乎立刻就消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……繼續敲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（敲門）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"門內的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快就回來了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷爾金，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特？我不是讓你們在外面等——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……別喬克？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼在這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以，你們都是受到指示，從礦區出來找補給的礦工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，完全正確，好心的先生！我代替那個魯莽的傢伙向您道歉，他基本上沒有離開過礦井，才會分不清好人和壞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激動的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是對不起，我們之前向其他村莊求助的時候，發生過一些不愉快的事情，我還以為這次也一樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個很真誠的孩子呢。至於其他村莊的人會怎麼對感染者，我也清楚……不如說，大部分的烏薩斯人都這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你們又不是那些不服從管理，一心只想製造混亂的感染者。你們是礦工，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然！您一定也知道，如果沒有上面的長官允許，我們可走不出礦區半步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位是我們的工頭。上面要求他在找到補給之後，才能帶我們回去復命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"要是找不到補給，上面的老爺是不是就不讓你們吃飯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，是的。我們這些成年人還好，只是像“小枝條”這樣的孩子，年紀這麼小忍受不了飢餓，這該怎麼辦呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝條”？是說這孩子？她也是礦工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"……你幾歲了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十、十——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"十歲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五歲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你有點害羞呢，就像我女兒……如果她還活著，她的孩子都應該跟你差不多大了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"她染上石頭病之後就主動去了礦區。不過那個地方不在這邊，在東部，北原礦場？總之是更遠的地方……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"別喬克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦、礦區，很好。別……別擔心，爺爺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺……哈哈，爺爺……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不知道是在什麼時候，什麼原因讓她得了病。問她，她也不願意說。我已經很久沒收到她的消息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不說這個了！管理你們礦區的人應該對你們還不錯，不像有些完全不管死活的，不給吃的，也不給他們其他的活路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說有些礦工為了活命，寧願被糾察隊抓去也要逃走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問您能幫助我們嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們進來之前，我的妻子就已經出去找其他人商量這件事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來那些腳印是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特，零件呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我這裡，給你。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷爾金接過，把用衣物包裹的東西直接遞給眼前的老人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是給您的。應該能把它裝在收割機上，替換老化的零件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不想白白讓您送出存糧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"好，很好……老實說，我也不懂這些，只知道收割機確實壞了一段時間了。如果你想幫忙，可以幫我直接把它換上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的礦工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1970_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來看看吧，我以前是機械廠的工人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那再好不過了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……竟然真的換到糧食了，而且還不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根納季先生說，這裡今年明明是個豐年，收割機卻壞了。好不容易人工收完了苔麥，沒想到根本沒有商隊來，多餘的糧食也就賣不出去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有錢，大家的日子過得比較拮据。就算這樣，他們還是願意把東西拿出來給我們，而不是等到開春再賣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利特說那些零件比苔麥值錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就我們現在的情況而言，糧食才是無價的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"小夥子……你們必須馬上就回去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們完成了任務，確實應該回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"我還想說讓你們把肚子都填飽了再走呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"就算不跟我們一起，西邊還有一些空屋，是以前村裡的幾戶人家搬走後留下來的，你可以讓大家去那裡，自己生火，做點吃的，暖暖身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝您……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不知道要怎麼才能表達感謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。那位了不起的小姐幫我們修好了收割機，來年就能派上用場，真的要說的話，我們才要感謝你們呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我們其實也沒幫上什麼忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"村子裡，大家過冬的儲備糧多數是不能動的，雖然現在糾察隊比較少來，但稅吏時不時來一趟也一樣讓人吃不消。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"現在也就是我們幾個老頭子從各戶的存糧裡多少拿一點出來，好讓你們回去交差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"其他的我們也幫不上忙了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許您能把您女兒的名字告訴我，我們——嗯——回到礦區之後，也許能託人幫您問問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，她不在我們遠北！她在北原，要往東邊過去，很遠的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷爾金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您告訴我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，反正告訴你也沒什麼關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"友善的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_092","isRemote":false,"text":"她叫米拉娜……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g14_ursusvillage"},{"type":"narration","text":"暗處，一雙空洞無神的眼睛窺伺著所有人。\n營火劈啪，輕易掩去了他含糊的呢喃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救贖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
